# knit's extras on its SEL list (the Prophet's: a synced patch's master quiet, the sweep on osc 1's pulse width), in
# rayon's Ops page's bytes (synth.h TP_K1CUT, TP_KSWTO): OSC 1 LEVEL 100% at first, ALGORITHM down to 92%; SWEEP TO
# osc 2's pitch, then osc 1's width (an engine change sets them back: ui.c sound_reset)
wait 300
param 2 engine knit
spin ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap EDIT
tap SEL
expect listopen 1
rowval OSC 1 LEVEL = 100%
rowval SWEEP TO = osc 2 pitch
row OSC 1 LEVEL
turn ALGO -10
expect par2.k1cut 10
rowval OSC 1 LEVEL = 92%
row SWEEP TO
turn ALGO 1
expect par2.kswto 1
rowval SWEEP TO = osc 1 width
tap HOME
